  constants: m_ph = 5.09 keV = 9.074e-33 kg; a0 = 9.36190e-11 m/s^2; sigma_gal = 119.21 km/s; T_b(5 keV) = 9.173 K; M500_med(HeCS) = 2.405 x1e14 Msun, R500_med = 0.700 Mpc; NFW c500 = 4.5

====================================================================================================
PART 1 -- THE INVERSION: sigma_los -> sigma_r (Mamon-Lokas with the measured beta) -> T_dark(r)
====================================================================================================
    sigma_los(0.5-1 R500, r=0.707) = 952 +- 24 km/s (G203 table interpolated)
