    A(r) = <(R/r)^2>_LOS (NFW c500=4.5): 0.5-1 0.618, 1-1.5 0.643, 1.5-2 0.639, 2-3 0.647, 3-5 0.648   [1/2 exactly for the isothermal r^-2 class; >1/2 as NFW steepens]

