    T_dark/T_gas median @ 2-5 R500 = 7.13e-06 (~5.1 orders of magnitude below the ICM)

  the equilibrium sigma (mass-free, G084/G116): sigma_eq^2 = (1/2) sqrt(G M_b a0):
    galaxy class  M_b = 6.5e+10 -> sigma_eq = 119.21 km/s  (registered 119.21);  T_b(m=5 keV) = 9.173 K  [anchor identity: 9.3 K at m = 5.09 keV]
